        "move_rotting_smell_vicious_cloud",
        "loc_chaotic_rock_grotto_heaven",
        "loc_strange_hair_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Ice Crystal grotto-heaven, Demon Judgment Board’s killer moves leave the eggman Gu Immortals covered in blood, forced to save themselves instead of assembling the formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_ice_crystal_grotto_heaven",
        "house_demon_judgment_board"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Xia clan headquarters in Eastern Sea, Rotten Egg Grotto Lord stands clustered with Chaotic Rock Grotto Lord and Hair Monster Grotto Lord around Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch, opposite Xiao He Jian’s faction among the returned two-heavens lords.",
      "chapters": [
        2068
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-politics",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xia_clan",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_xiao_he_jian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave, the six eggman Gu Immortals from Rotten Egg grotto-heaven form Rotting Smell Vicious Cloud and trap Nie Kuang Feng for a time. Nie Kuang Feng breaks out; the six spit blood and are either dead or injured.",
      "chapters": [
        2165
